# Windows-only Photoshop MCP / PaintPilot runtime configuration examples.
# Set PHOTOSHOP_PATH only when automatic Photoshop discovery does not work.
# PHOTOSHOP_PATH=C:\Program Files\Adobe\Adobe Photoshop 2026\Photoshop.exe
#
# Logging: 0=DEBUG, 1=INFO, 2=WARN, 3=ERROR.
# LOG_LEVEL=1
#
# For Chat On Steroids, use dist/cos-plugin.js. It enables required Guard
# mode automatically; arbitrary inherited analytics variables are not used.
